vl-release (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add npm package releases: [npm] tarball contracts, `vlr build-npm`,
    `vlr publish-npm` and `vlr verify-npm` for [[publish.npm]] registries.
    - Idempotent, integrity-checked publication: every registry is planned
      before any upload; identical dist.integrity is skipped, different bytes
      are refused, dist-tags never move backwards.
    - npm trusted publishing (OIDC), token and basic auth; credentials only in
      a temporary 0600 userconfig.
  * `vlr check` validates package.json for [npm]; `validate-artifacts`,
    `artifacts`, `status`, `doctor` and the agent skill know about npm
    packages.

